.Dd May 1, 2024
.Dt PPPOETEST 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pppoetest
.Nd PPPoE Load Balancer Testing and Diagnostic Tool
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar mode
.Op Fl options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility provides comprehensive testing and diagnostic capabilities for the
.Xr ng_pppoe_lb 4
kernel module and
.Xr pppoed 8
daemon.
.Pp
The default mode is
.Cm diagnose ,
which provides passive observation of existing PPPoE sessions without creating
any new sessions, making it safe for production systems.
.Pp
Other modes create test sessions and are intended for testing environments.
.Sh MODES
.Bl -tag -width diagnose
.It Cm diagnose
Passive observation of existing sessions.
This is the DEFAULT mode and is production-safe.
.It Cm accuracy
Test session distribution accuracy.
Creates test sessions to verify distribution algorithms.
.It Cm affinity
Test session affinity (stickiness).
Verifies sessions return to the same worker after reconnection.
.It Cm transfer
Test file transfer with checksums.
Streams data through PPPoE sessions with integrity verification.
.It Cm governor
Test auto-scaling behavior.
Verifies the CPU governor triggers scaling correctly.
.It Cm stress
High-load stress testing.
Creates many sessions rapidly to test system stability.
.It Cm benchmark
Performance benchmarking.
Measures throughput, latency, CPU overhead, and memory usage.
.It Cm menu
Interactive menu.
Allows selection of operations without memorizing options.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Ss Diagnose Mode Options
.Bl -tag -width "--check-affinity"
.It Fl s , -show-workers
Show all workers and their states.
.It Fl S , -show-sessions
Show all active sessions.
.It Fl g , -show-governor
Show governor state and decisions.
.It Fl H , -health-score
Show overall health score.
.It Fl -check-affinity
Check for session affinity violations.
.It Fl -check-balance
Check load balance across workers.
.It Fl -monitor
Enable real-time monitoring.
.It Fl i , Fl interval Ns = N
Monitoring interval in seconds (default: 5).
.It Fl -imbalance-threshold Ns = N
Deviation percentage to trigger warning (default: 20).
.It Fl -health-threshold Ns = N
Deviation percentage to trigger error (default: 40).
.El
.Ss Test Mode Options
.Bl -tag -width "-n"
.It Fl n , Fl sessions Ns = N
Number of sessions to create (default: 100).
.It Fl a , Fl algorithm Ns = N
Algorithm to test: 0=round-robin, 1=hash, 2=least-loaded.
.It Fl w , Fl workers Ns = N
Number of workers (default: 4).
.It Fl t , Fl threshold Ns = N
Acceptable deviation percentage (default: 10).
.It Fl r , Fl retries Ns = N
Reconnection attempts per session (for affinity tests).
.It Fl f , Fl file Ns = Ar path
File to transfer (for transfer mode).
.It Fl b , Fl buffer-size Ns = N
Buffer size in bytes (default: 65536).
.It Fl d , Fl duration Ns = N
Test duration in seconds.
.It Fl -trigger Ar action
Governor trigger: scale-up or scale-down.
.It Fl v , Fl verbose
Show per-worker details.
.El
.Ss Output Options
.Bl -tag -width "-o"
.It Fl o , Fl output Ar format
Output format: console, json, jsonl, csv, or tap.
.It Fl -no-color
Disable color output.
.It Fl q , Fl quiet
Quiet mode (minimal output).
.El
.Ss Connection Options
.Bl -tag -width "-p"
.It Fl h , Fl host Ar hostname
Server hostname (default: localhost).
.It Fl p , Fl port Ar port
Control port (default: 9001).
.It Fl -server
Run as server (for transfer mode).
.It Fl -client
Run as client (for transfer mode).
.El
.Ss Other Options
.Bl -tag -width "--version"
.It Fl \&? , Fl -help
Show help message.
.It Fl -version
Show version information.
.El
.Sh HEALTH SCORE INTERPRETATION
The health score is a combined metric (0-100) evaluating:
.Bl -tag -width "90-100"
.It 90-100
System is healthy, operating normally.
.It 70-89
Warning state, some metrics need attention.
.It 50-69
Failure state, significant issues detected.
.It 0-49
Critical state, immediate attention required.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Ss Diagnose Existing System (Production Safe)
.Bd -literal
pppoetest
.Ed
.Pp
Shows workers, governor status, and health score without creating sessions.
.Ss Show Specific Diagnostics
.Bd -literal
pppoetest diagnose -s -g
.Ed
.Pp
Show workers and governor status only.
.Ss Real-Time Monitoring
.Bd -literal
pppoetest diagnose --monitor -i 5
.Ed
.Pp
Monitor system state, updating every 5 seconds.
.Ss Check Load Balance
.Bd -literal
pppoetest diagnose --check-balance --imbalance-threshold 15
.Ed
.Pp
Check load balance with 15% deviation threshold.
.Ss Test Governor Scaling
.Bd -literal
pppoetest governor --trigger scale-up
.Ed
.Pp
Test governor scale-up trigger.
.Ss Interactive Menu
.Bd -literal
pppoetest menu
.Ed
.Pp
Display interactive menu for operation selection.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ".Pa /usr/share/examples/netgraph/pppoe_lb/_pppoetest" -compact
.It Pa /usr/share/examples/netgraph/pppoe_lb/_pppoetest
Bash/Zsh shell completion for
.Nm .
.El
